<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 41.64 to 7289.40.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.24 to 441.54.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.02.</p>
<p>Advancers outpaced decliners 1534 to 968.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 432,664,060 compared with 532,424,840 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
